gned to Lok, Sophie, and Den along with Guggenheim to investigate a rogue titan in the Cathedral. The Titan was revealed to be the Gremlow but using its \"Swarm\" ability, it was able to create an entire colony of identical Titans, growing by the minute. To stop them, Sophie purchased a flute, using the notes on a stained glass window within the cathedral to transform it into the Pied Pipe once used by the Pied Piper himself. Using it, Sophie made Gremlow return to its amulet to complete the mission. The team faced a pair of Suits while purchasing the flute. [Gremlow Infestation!]","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox mission\n| name        = The Piper of Hamelin\n| image       = File:The_Piper_of_Hamelin.png\n| city        = [[Hamelin, Germany]]\n| location    = [[Hamelin Cathedral]]\n| members     = [[Guggenheim]] <br> [[Den Fears]]<br>[[Lok Lambert]] <br> [[Sophie Casterwill]] \n| objectives  = Investigate the rogue Titan in [[Hamelin Cathedral]]\n| episode     = \"[[Gremlow Infestation!]]\"\n}}\n'''The Piper of Hamlin''' was a mission assigned to [[Lok]], [[Sophie]], and [[Den Fears|Den]] along with [[Guggenheim]] to investigate a rogue titan in the Cathedral. The Titan was revealed to be the [[Gremlow]] but using its \"Swarm\" ability, it was able to create an entire colony of identical Titans, growing by the minute. To stop them, Sophie purchased a flute, using the notes on a stained glass window within the cathedral to transform it into the [[Pied Pipe]] once used by the [[Pied Piper]] himself. Using it, Sophie made Gremlow return to its amulet to complete the mission. The team faced a pair of Suits while purchasing the flute. {{Source|Gremlow Infestation!}}\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation Missions]]","categories":["Huntik Foundation Missions"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:14916","status":"resolved","target_title":"Hamelin, Germany","label":"Hamelin, Germany","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Hamelin%2C_Germany","href":"#/categories?name=Hamelin%2C%20Germ